      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEESY EASY (2) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at Q Straight in a handy 16.84 beating Rainmaker Joe. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Looks the testing material. STRIKES TWICE (1) bolted in last time, scoring by 3 lengths in slick time (21.91) to take a Mix 5 in a new PB this course and distance. Expected to feature again. SPRING NICK (5) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by a neck at this track in a handy 20.01 beating Hope Moo Moo. Awkwardly drawn but in form and has the ability. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. LUCORA (3) is building a solid run wins and will play a big role again.",
